    "created_at": "2016-10-26T17:18:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-26T17:18:05Z",
    "body": "At first, WebAssembly will go through JavaScript for all Web API access. The WebAssembly-specific APIs would, in the next stage, be targeted to things like WebGL. We could leave in language-neutral language in preparation for WebAssembly, but I don't think it describes the current web platform.\n",
